#X text 83 16 - define a data structure template;
#X text 48 64 A [struct] object is used to define a Data Structure template and its fields. There should be one [struct] object in each Pd window you are using as a data structure template. The arguments specify the types and names of the fields. The data types are: "float" \, "symbol" \, "text" and "array". Each type needs a field name. Array fields take an extra argument that specifies the template that the array elements should belong to \, and an optional float arqument to initialize the number of elements., f 71;
